- find_desktop_directories_not_in_%2Egitrepos.py: port to D as a new check (directories on disk that .gitrepos doesn't list).
- find_directories_in_%2Egitignore_not_on_disk.py: probably delete; check() and checkDisk() cover it (#7).
- find_and_remove_desktop_directories_not_in_%2Egitrepos.py: delete, or port very carefully; it deletes directories and is broken (#11).
